# Markdownlint ignore file (https://github.com/DavidAnson/markdownlint/blob/main/doc/Configuration.md)
#
# Patterns added here are excluded from CLI runs like
# `markdownlint-cli2 "**/*.md"`. Each entry below documents
# why it is excluded.
#
# SECURITY (prettier foot-gun): PL/pgSQL files are misparsed
# by markdownlint's HTML-aware rules when they appear inside
# fenced code blocks that wrap to long lines. The exclusion
# below keeps that concern off the radar.
database/**/*.sql
# Generated / vendor - keeps the tooling output clean and focused.
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
.husky/_/
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/
